  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43788628",
      "title": "Creating & Conditionally Rendering Another Component",
      "lectureOrder": 51,
      "videoOrder": 47,
      "sourceHash": "afa14b2496b9c9dc0944a16046835e244345b941a4cd7fea56377b86de418614",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 1.68,
          "en": "Now that we're able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.68,
          "end": 5.31,
          "en": "to mark tasks as completed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.31,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "we, of course, also wanna make sure that we can add tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 12.99,
          "en": "And here, I got another exercise for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.99,
          "end": 16.77,
          "en": "I want you to create a first basic version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.77,
          "end": 20.04,
          "en": "of such a component which doesn't need any styling at all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.04,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "doesn't matter where it appears, doesn't need a form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 26.4,
          "en": "just some shell which output some text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.4,
          "end": 28.98,
          "en": "And I want you to build that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.98,
          "end": 30.6,
          "en": "add it to the application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.6,
          "end": 34.5,
          "en": "and make sure that it shows up anywhere on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.5,
          "end": 38.493,
          "en": "doesn't matter where, when that Add Task button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.54,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "So that you add the code that listens for a click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 45.48,
          "en": "and that then conditionally renders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.48,
          "end": 48.96,
          "en": "this newly added new-task.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.96,
          "end": 51.09,
          "en": "That's your task right now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.09,
          "end": 54.24,
          "en": "After a short pause, which you can use to pause the video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.24,
          "end": 57.843,
          "en": "and try this on your own, we'll implement this together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.87,
          "end": 64.38,
          "en": "So let's add this new component together now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.38,
          "end": 67.26,
          "en": "For this, I'm back in the project, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.26,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "and I'll again use the CLI to generate a new component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 74.52,
          "en": "and I wanna have that component in the tasks folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.52,
          "end": 76.14099999999999,
          "en": "And then they are,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.14099999999999,
          "end": 79.863,
          "en": "it's the new-task.component I want to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.94,
          "end": 82.44,
          "en": "And if you have component names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.44,
          "end": 84.18,
          "en": "that consist of multiple names,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.18,
          "end": 86.733,
          "en": "you should separate them with a dash like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.72,
          "end": 89.25,
          "en": "I don't need the tests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.25,
          "end": 93.09,
          "en": "so again, I will add --skip-tests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.09,
          "end": 97.68299999999999,
          "en": "And with that, this new, new-task folder here is added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.69,
          "end": 101.13,
          "en": "Now as mentioned at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.13,
          "end": 103.8,
          "en": "I don't care how it looks and where it appears,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.8,
          "end": 107.22,
          "en": "so I'll just keep that default starting content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.22,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "this dummy text here in the new-task.component.html file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "And I just wanna make sure that it shows up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 119.13,
          "en": "if this button in the task component here is clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.13,
          "end": 122.193,
          "en": "if this Add-Task button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.6,
          "end": 126.21,
          "en": "Therefore I'll start by adding a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.21,
          "end": 128.163,
          "en": "to this Add Task button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.3,
          "end": 131.61,
          "en": "and I'll then add a new method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.61,
          "end": 134.313,
          "en": "to this tasks.component.ts file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.27,
          "end": 140.27,
          "en": "And I'll name this method onStartAddTask,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.49,
          "end": 142.8,
          "en": "because this kind of describes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.8,
          "end": 146.01,
          "en": "what's happening when the button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.01,
          "end": 150.32999999999998,
          "en": "We start the process of adding a new task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 153.09,
          "en": "by conditionally showing a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.09,
          "end": 156.78300000000002,
          "en": "that will allow us to enter the task details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.19,
          "end": 163.19,
          "en": "I also need an extra property which controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.23,
          "end": 168.03,
          "en": "whether this new-task.component is visible or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.03,
          "end": 172.56,
          "en": "Therefore, here at the top, maybe above the tasks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.56,
          "end": 175.14,
          "en": "the exact position doesn't matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.14,
          "end": 179.287,
          "en": "I'll add a new property called isAddingTask.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 182.28,
          "end": 183.51,
          "en": "The name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 183.51,
          "end": 186.09,
          "en": "but it should be a name that describes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 186.09,
          "end": 189.153,
          "en": "the value that's stored in the property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 190.11,
          "end": 192.573,
          "en": "And here, I'll set this to false initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.71,
          "end": 196.8,
          "en": "And since I'm assigning that initial value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 196.8,
          "end": 200.7,
          "en": "types script is able to infer the type of value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 200.7,
          "end": 204.003,
          "en": "I plan on storing on this property in general.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 204.93,
          "end": 208.82999999999998,
          "en": "It correctly infers that it'll be a Boolean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.82999999999998,
          "end": 211.023,
          "en": "which I'll store in this property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 212.34,
          "end": 213.21,
          "en": "As a side note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 213.21,
          "end": 217.07999999999998,
          "en": "you could explicitly add this type annotation nonetheless,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.07999999999998,
          "end": 220.62,
          "en": "but this is not required and also not recommended",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.62,
          "end": 223.113,
          "en": "if the inferred type is the correct type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.73,
          "end": 227.94,
          "en": "So isAddingTask is false initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 227.94,
          "end": 231.18,
          "en": "but it should be changed to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 231.18,
          "end": 234.09300000000002,
          "en": "if we trigger onStartAddTask.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 236.04,
          "end": 240.273,
          "en": "So in here, I want to set isAddingTask to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 242.22,
          "end": 246.33,
          "en": "And now, in the tasks.component.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 246.33,
          "end": 251.07,
          "en": "I want to use this newly added, isAddingTask property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 251.07,
          "end": 255.213,
          "en": "to conditionally show this new-task.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 256.26,
          "end": 260.55,
          "en": "So we can use @if here, and check if isAddingTask is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 263.34,
          "end": 268.053,
          "en": "And if it is, I wanna output app-new-task,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 268.92,
          "end": 273.21,
          "en": "that is the selector of this new-task.component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 273.21,
          "end": 274.983,
          "en": "that was added by the CLI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 276.93,
          "end": 280.08,
          "en": "Now as always, this must be added to the imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 280.08,
          "end": 283.98,
          "en": "in order to be available in the tasks component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 283.98,
          "end": 286.2,
          "en": "So that is something that must be done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 286.2,
          "end": 288.84000000000003,
          "en": "The NewTaskComponent must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 288.84000000000003,
          "end": 291.09000000000003,
          "en": "and added to the imports here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 291.09000000000003,
          "end": 293.763,
          "en": "but with that done, it can be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 294.93,
          "end": 299.1,
          "en": "And then here, with this event binding on this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 299.1,
          "end": 300.93,
          "en": "we can and should execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 300.93,
          "end": 304.473,
          "en": "this newly added onStartAddTask method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 305.73,
          "end": 309.63,
          "en": "With that, if you save that and you click Add Task,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 309.63,
          "end": 312.96,
          "en": "you will see that this new-task.component appears",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 312.96,
          "end": 315.66,
          "en": "and that's therefore working as it should.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 315.66,
          "end": 318.42,
          "en": "Now we can start working on that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 318.42,
          "end": 321.6,
          "en": "so that we do actually open it as a dialogue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 321.6,
          "end": 323.013,
          "en": "and show some form.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
